  "headline": "Bareskrim Identifies Four Posts Linked To Alleged Treason Attempt",
  "seoTitle": "Bareskrim Investigates Four Posts in Treason Allegations",
  "metaDescription": "Indonesian investigators discovered four locations in Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang allegedly tied to a plot involving intercepted government communication.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Bareskrim Polri located four sites across Jakarta, Bogor, and Tangerang allegedly functioning as headquarters for a treason conspiracy.",
    "Evidence seized during recent searches includes various documents and banners linked to the ongoing investigation into the alleged plot.",
    "The investigation involves high-ranking officials including Brigjen Tedjo and Kombes Iman, whose property in Bogor was reportedly searched."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police's Criminal Investigation Agency, Bareskrim, is actively investigating a series of locations connected to an alleged treason plot involving attempts to intercept communications related to President Prabowo. Authorities have expanded their search efforts to include five specific sites across Bogor and Tangerang, identifying four of these as dedicated base camps for the suspected activities. During these operations, police retrieved multiple items, such as banners and various documents, which are now being analyzed as part of the case against suspects including Listyo and others. Public reports have identified additional figures linked to the case, specifically Brigjen Tedjo and Kombes Iman, the latter being a former official whose residence in Bogor was identified as one of the investigated sites. Due to the ongoing nature of the evidence collection, police have opted to postpone their formal case briefing.",
